{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1355720/extras/a2a7e32d1831afa1b46eca47d05760b9.poster.avif?t=1772413419\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1355720/extras/a2a7e32d1831afa1b46eca47d05760b9.webm?t=1772413419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1355720/extras/a2a7e32d1831afa1b46eca47d05760b9.mp4?t=1772413419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In bizarre lands, play as a viscous glob of water as you follow a trail of droplets and discover your fate. Test your reflexes and use your unique abilities to evade enemies and find your path in this surreal platformer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Henosis is a complete, self-contained surreal puzzle experience; no updates, no grind, no live-service hooks. Just atmosphere, mystery, and perspective-bending puzzles. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse your way through 25 hand-crafted levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique platform and player mechanics </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle 5 menacing bosses across 4 distinct worlds </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Partial controller support </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Localization support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full release and no in-game purchases or ads</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tight platforming and multiple hazards to get through.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1355720/extras/64195208e8991023ed42a9755244b591.poster.avif?t=1772413419\" width=616 h